  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "Haunted by her mother's life as a mistress, Minkyeong carries only bitterness toward her father. She builds a fragile peace away from him, until a stranger named Jinhyeok enters her world. With calm but forceful resolve, he declares that wherever she runs, he will always find her. What begins in fear slowly becomes a dangerous comfort. However, on the day she offers him a birthday gift, the fragile boundary between them collapses. What follows after is not happiness, but a love steeped in destruction.\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
